    "supplier:Brindlecote IT Services Ltd": {
      "subject": "Invoice BIT-2026-1043: change of bank details",
      "body": "Hello Dan,\n\nWe have received invoice BIT-2026-1043, dated 1 October 2026, for £540.00, together with an email saying your bank details have changed. The new details on the invoice (sort code 00-99-01) are different from the ones we hold for you.\n\nBefore any payment is made, we will phone you on the number we already have on file to confirm the change. We never change bank details because of an email, so please don't send bank details by reply.\n\nKind regards,\nAccounts Assistant\nDemo Company Ltd"
