      "body": "Hello Steve,\n\nThank you for invoice CWS-40218, dated 14 October 2026. The net amount is £210.00 and the VAT is £42.00, which comes to £252.00, but the total due is shown as £262.00, a difference of £10.00.\n\nCould you send a corrected invoice, please? We will hold this one until it arrives, so a reply by Friday 13 November would be appreciated.\n\nKind regards,\nAccounts Assistant\nDemo Company Ltd"
